		<div id="wcnq1g8">
			<div class="BackgroundWhiteElement">
				<div class="RelativePositionElement IsolateElement OverflowHiddenElement BackgroundGradientToBottomElement FromZincOneHundredTwentyPercentElement PaddingTopTwoElement">
					<div class="AbsolutePositionElement InsetYZeroElement RightHalfElement NegativeZIndexTenElement NegativeMarginRightNinetySixElement WidthTwoHundredPercentElement OriginTopRightElement SkewXNegativeThirtyFiveDegreesElement BackgroundWhiteElement ShadowExtraLargeElement ShadowZincSixHundredTenPercentElement RingOneElement RingZincFiftyElement SmallNegativeMarginRightEightyElement LargeNegativeMarginRightNinetySixElement" aria-hidden="true"></div>
					<div class="MarginXAutoElement MaxWidthSevenXLElement PaddingXSixElement PaddingYFourteenElement">
						<div class="MarginXAutoElement MaxWidthTwoXLElement LargeMarginXZeroElement LargeGridElement LargeMaxWidthNoneElement LargeGridColumnsTwoElement LargeGapXSixteenElement LargeGapYSixElement ExtraLargeGridColumnsOneElement ExtraLargeGridRowsOneElement ExtraLargeGapXEightElement">
							<h1 class="MaxWidthTwoXLElement TextFourXLElement FontBoldElement TrackingTightElement TextGrayNineHundredElement SmallTextSixXLElement LargeColumnSpanTwoElement ExtraLargeColumnAutoElement">A Thoughtful Approach to Beauty and Self-Care</h1>
							<div class="MarginTopSixElement MaxWidthExtraLargeElement LargeMarginTopZeroElement ExtraLargeColumnEndOneElement ExtraLargeRowStartOneElement">
								<p class="TextLargeElement LeadingEightElement TextGraySixHundredElement">
									Welcome to Fresh Bloom Salon, a beauty salon concept centred on helping you feel comfortable as you explore personal care options. Browse the information on this page to learn about the salon’s approach, consider which services may fit your preferences and find answers to common questions. Every visit is personal, so you can share what matters to you and ask for clarification before making a decision. Service availability, pricing, appointment details and the salon’s
									current location are not listed here; please contact Fresh Bloom Salon to confirm them before planning a visit. Our aim is to make the first step feel clear, welcoming and free from unnecessary pressure.
								</p>
								<div class="MarginTopTenElement FlexElement ItemsCenterElement GapXSixElement">
									<a href="#" class="RoundedLargeElement bg--600 PaddingXSixElement PaddingYFourElement TextLargeElement FontSemiBoldElement TextWhiteElement ShadowSmallElement hover:bg--500 FocusVisibleOutlineElement FocusVisibleOutlineTwoElement FocusVisibleOutlineOffsetTwoElement focus-visible:outline--600"></a>
								</div>
							</div>
							<img src="img/bd92fc53794fbbf619b105a4425be04b.jpg" alt="" class="MarginTopTenElement AspectRatioSixByFiveElement FullWidthElement MaxWidthLargeElement RoundedTwoXLElement ObjectCoverElement SmallMarginTopSixteenElement LargeMarginTopZeroElement LargeMaxWidthNoneElement ExtraLargeRowSpanTwoElement ExtraLargeRowEndTwoElement ExtraLargeMarginTopThirtySixElement" />
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="AbsolutePositionElement InsetXZeroElement BottomZeroElement NegativeZIndexTenElement HeightTwentyFourElement BackgroundGradientToTopElement FromWhiteElement SmallHeightThirtyTwoElement"></div>
				</div>
			</div>
